'''Giraffe Unit-01''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked when beating any stage in [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event#The 9th Angel Strikes!|The 9th Angel Strikes!]] during the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 6.10 Update|Version 6.10]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 404
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Giraffe Unit-01
|name2 = Giraffe Unit-02
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Giraffe Unit-02''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Giraffe Unit-01 has little use outside of the early game, where he can help rush some stages alongside [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]], but that's about it. He can also be used as a gap closer that is better than Giraffe Cat, but worse than [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Giraffe Cat]].

The most use this collab cat has is boosting [[User Rank]] and being a {{4c}} replacement for Giraffe Cat.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump & Rusher}}

